  stem: 'A buffer is made by mixing 0.200 mol dm-3 ethanoic acid with 0.100 mol dm-3 sodium ethanoate in equal volumes. Ka(CH3COOH) = 1.74 x 10-5 mol dm-3.\n\nCalculate the pH of the buffer. [3]',
